    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "爱米：你好，我是607房间的客人。我想洗澡，但是我的房间没有热水，你能帮帮我吗？",
      "traditional": "愛米：你好，我是607房間的客人。我想洗澡，但是我的房間沒有熱水，你能幫幫我嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ nǐ hǎo wǒ shì 3 fáng jiān de kè rén wǒ xiǎng xǐ zǎo dàn shì wǒ de fáng jiān méi yǒu rè shuǐ nǐ néng bāng bāng wǒ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Hello, I am the guest in room 607. I want to take a shower, but there’s no hot water in my room. Can you help me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "前台：您好，非常对不起。我马上让人上去看一看。",
      "traditional": "前臺：您好，非常對不起。我馬上讓人上去看一看。",
      "pinyin": "qián tái nín hǎo fēi cháng duì bu qǐ wǒ mǎ shàng ràng rén shàng qù kàn yí kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Front desk: Hello, I’m very sorry. I’ll have someone up there right away to take a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "（一会儿后）",
      "traditional": "（一會兒後）",
      "pinyin": "yí huì'r hòu",
